        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joel 1:14",
        "book": "Joel",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Alas for the day! for the day of the Lord is at hand, and as a destruction from the Almighty shall it come.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "Jer. 46:10; Amos 5:18. TG Day of the Lord."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 44
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Joel 1:15",
        "book": "Joel",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "Is not the meat cut off before our eyes, yea, joy and gladness from the house of our God?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "OR food."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 41,
